    slug: "pci-dss-4-what-changed-merchants",
    title: "PCI DSS 4.0: What Changed and What Merchants Must Do Now",
    excerpt: "PCI DSS 4.0 introduces significant changes to payment security requirements. Learn what's new, what's different, and the steps merchants must take to stay compliant.",
    category: "Compliance",
    author: "Liberty Bancard Team",
    readTime: "11 min read",
    publishDate: "April 1, 2025",
    publishedISO: "2025-04-01T08:00:00Z",
